    { name: 'Ssiat Hotteok', neighborhood: 'BIFF Square, Jung-gu', category: 'cafe', description: "The original hotteok stall at BIFF Square, stuffed with seeds and nuts instead of sugar — a Busan street food tradition since the 1980s." },
